eclaimers Guild outpost and were gone by dark.","kind":"outpost_assault","hour":15.949999999999996},{"text":"What began as one clash pulled in whole alliances; the Conspiracy Architects bloc carried it, 1 columns fallen.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":15.949999999999996},{"text":"Raiders of the Conspiracy Architects breached the Reclaimers Guild palisade and sacked the stores within.","kind":"outpost_assault","hour":15.949999999999996},{"text":"The Mud Monarchs stormed the Reclaimers Guild outpost at first light and left it smoking.","kind":"outpost_assault","hour":15.949999999999996},{"text":"Banners of the Mud Monarchs drew their allies in and rolled over the True Tartarians host; 3 columns lay broken by dusk.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":15.949999999999996},{"text":"The Conspiracy Architects bloc met the Reclaimers Guild coalition in force at a dry crossroads — a true battle, and 3 patrols never rode home.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":15.949999999999996},{"text":"The Conspiracy Architects put the Reclaimers Guild outpost to the torch and drove off its garrison.","kind":"outpost_assault","hour":15.949999999999996},{"text":"Banners of the Conspiracy Architects drew their allies in and rolled over the Reclaimers Guild host; 3 columns lay broken by dusk.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"Allies of the Mud Monarchs converged on a Eternal Dynasty war-party and turned a skirmish into a slaughter. 2 columns lost.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"Two blocs collided near the flats — the Stone Builders and their allies held the field, the True Tartarians left 3 columns in the dust.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"What began as one clash pulled in whole alliances; the Conspiracy Architects bloc carried it, 3 columns fallen.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"The Mud Monarchs rallied their allies and enveloped the Eternal Dynasty host in the open — 3 war-parties broke.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"A running bloc-battle raged for hours; the Stone Builders coalition ground down the True Tartarians, 3 patrols spent between them.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"The Mud Monarchs took a hard loss near the frontier — and the Stone Builders are paying good coin to press the advantage.","hour":16.049999999999997,"kind":"setback"},{"text":"What began as one clash pulled in whole alliances; the Conspiracy Architects bloc carried it, 3 columns fallen.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"The Eternal Dynasty coalition was caught between the Mud Monarchs and their allies and cut to pieces — 3 war-parties lost.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"Two blocs collided near the flats — the Stone Builders and their allies held the field, the True Tartarians left 3 columns in the dust.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"A set-piece battle of blocs near the ruins — the Conspiracy Architects and allies stood; the Reclaimers Guild coalition shattered, 3 patrols lost.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"Banners of the Stone Builders drew their allies in and rolled over the True Tartarians host; 3 columns lay broken by dusk.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"Sworn banners answered the call on both sides; the Mud Monarchs out-bled the Eternal Dynasty, 2 columns gone to the sand.","kind":"bloc_battle","hour":16.049999999999997},{"text":"The Tartarian Revivalists are purging Conspiracy Architects sympathizers from their holdings.","hour":16.049999999999997,"kind":"purge"},{"text":"The Mud Monarchs press their claim across the waste, and the Forgotten Order give ground.","hour":16.049999999999997,"kind":"surge"},{"text":"The Conspiracy Architects and the Forgotten Order have called an uneasy truce. For now.","hour":16.049999999999997,"kind":"truce"},{"text":"A Conspiracy Architects warband has taken to the r